### Opret film som USER (skal give 403)
POST http://localhost:7070/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Test med token",
  "releaseDate": "2020-01-01",
  "tmdbRating": 7.5,
  "tmdbId": 999
}

### Register en ny bruger
POST http://localhost:7070/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "seif",
  "password": "test123"
}


### Prøve at log ind med rigtige kode

POST http://localhost:7070/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "seif",
  "password": "test123"
}

> {% client.global.set("token",response.body.token);
 %}

### Login med forkert kodeord (burde give 401)
POST http://localhost:7070/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "seif",
  "password": "forkert"
}